sequenceDiagram
    actor Operator
    participant DataProvider
    participant SnapshotAdapter
    participant SldbGraph
    participant GraphStore
    participant Canvas
    Operator->>DataProvider: open editor
    DataProvider->>SldbGraph: fetch GraphSnapshot
    SldbGraph->>SnapshotAdapter: GraphSnapshot
    SnapshotAdapter->>DataProvider: snapshot_to_ui_graph -#gt; GraphData
    DataProvider->>GraphStore: loadGraph(nodes, edges)
    Operator->>Canvas: edit node/edge/attribute
    Canvas->>GraphStore: updateNode/addEdge/removeElements
    Operator->>DataProvider: save one document (NodeInspector)
    DataProvider->>SldbGraph: POST /sldb/save (that document only)
    SldbGraph->>DataProvider: ok